in a long time, in person.

00:00:11.334 --> 00:00:12.334
You've Zoomed.
-I know.

00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:14.300
-You've been nice enough
to Zoom with us.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.300
-I'm so happy to see you here.
-So good to see you.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
You like great.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.434
-And play with The Roots.

00:00:18.434 --> 00:00:19.601
-And play with The Roots
tonight.

00:00:19.601 --> 00:00:21.000
Come on.
-Yeah.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:24.167
-No one better, bud.
No one better.

00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:25.767
-Yeah, I'll always
come here for you.

00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:27.567
It's the most fun I have
on any show,

00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:31.234
and I'm happy to be
here for our debut as a duo.

00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:33.834
-Oh, yeah.
-Big New Year's Eve bash.

00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:35.501
-Oh, yeah.
-Big New Year's Eve bash.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:37.434
Pete, I just saw you at
the Kennedy Center Honors.

00:00:37.434 --> 00:00:38.434
-Yeah.
-Which is good.

00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:39.501
You look good in a tux, bud.

00:00:39.501 --> 00:00:40.901
-Thank you.
-Right.

00:00:40.901 --> 00:00:42.634
-It was the first time wearing
a suit in like four years.

00:00:42.634 --> 00:00:44.300
-Isn't it --
It was so weird to me.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:45.734
-It was super-weird.

00:00:45.734 --> 00:00:48.534
Me and you --
We were all there to honor

00:00:48.534 --> 00:00:50.067
Lorne Michaels, you know, for --

00:00:50.067 --> 00:00:52.534
He was getting -- What is it?
A Kennedy Honor.

00:00:52.534 --> 00:00:53.634
-Yeah, yeah,
a Kennedy Center Honor.

00:00:53.634 --> 00:00:55.634
-Yeah.
-That's right. Correct.

00:00:55.634 --> 00:00:58.400
-Yeah,
that's what he was getting.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.567
And we all had
to go onstage that night.

00:01:00.567 --> 00:01:02.734
And, like, you know,
I'm an emotional guy.

00:01:02.734 --> 00:01:07.000
You know, so, me and Jimmy were,
like, in the corner.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.601
And we were, like,
just looking for Lorne,

00:01:09.601 --> 00:01:11.067
because everybody's
clapping and standing.

00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:12.567
And there's like,
you know, 400 or 500 people,

00:01:12.567 --> 00:01:14.634
and Lorne's, like, you know,
a shorter guy,

00:01:14.634 --> 00:01:16.267
so he's just kind of in the mix.

00:01:16.267 --> 00:01:18.300
And we were just like,
"Lorne, Lorne, where's Lorne?"

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:20.100
And then me and --
Jimmy just goes, "Look."

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:22.033
And Lorne's like...

00:01:22.033 --> 00:01:23.834
And me and Jimmy just, like --

00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:26.868
Tears just started
streaming down our faces.

00:01:26.868 --> 00:01:28.400
-We got emotional.
-We got super-emotional.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:30.467
-We love the guy.
-Yeah, we love that guy.

00:01:30.467 --> 00:01:32.400
-I love that he waved at us,
'cause everyone else --

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.534
It's one of the biggest honors
you could ever get

00:01:34.534 --> 00:01:35.868
in this country, and
everyone else is just, like,

00:01:35.868 --> 00:01:37.334
bowing and "thank you"
and "thank you."

00:01:37.334 --> 00:01:39.901
And then he just saw us
and was like...

00:01:39.901 --> 00:01:41.934
That is so cool.
-The cutest, yeah.

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:44.968
-It was so real.
Do you guys go back from "SNL"?

00:01:44.968 --> 00:01:46.767
Is that where you guys met?

00:01:46.767 --> 00:01:48.033
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:01:48.033 --> 00:01:51.601
Originally, and then we kind of,
like, kept in touch.

00:01:51.601 --> 00:01:53.467
We went to -- I took Pete --

00:01:53.467 --> 00:01:55.534
I think it was your first time
going to a gay club.

00:01:55.534 --> 00:01:57.567
-Yes.
-Everyone loves him there.

00:01:57.567 --> 00:01:59.367
-I loved it.

00:01:59.367 --> 00:02:02.200
Yeah, I felt like
the coolest guy ever.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:04.801
-Yeah, at one point,
I looked over, and Pete --

00:02:04.801 --> 00:02:06.734
I don't know if he was
aware that there was, like,

00:02:06.734 --> 00:02:07.734
a penis on your head.

00:02:07.734 --> 00:02:09.000
-Oh, yeah.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.667
I was just, like, chilling there
with, like, a drink.

00:02:10.667 --> 00:02:12.467
Like, you know,
I never really go out,

00:02:12.467 --> 00:02:13.901
and she was nice enough
to invite me out.

00:02:13.901 --> 00:02:15.400
And I was just, you know,
sitting there.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:16.968
And for like, I guess,
20 minutes,

00:02:16.968 --> 00:02:21.033
this guy's [bleep]
was just, like, on my shoulder.

00:02:21.033 --> 00:02:23.467
I'm just, like,
smiling over there.

00:02:23.467 --> 00:02:25.100
And then I was like,
"Oh, alright."

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:26.367
-Wow!

00:02:26.367 --> 00:02:28.367
-Yeah.
I had a bruise the next day.

00:02:28.367 --> 00:02:30.567
I was like, "Jesus Christ."

00:02:30.567 --> 00:02:32.667
[ Cymbal crash ]
Oh!

00:02:32.667 --> 00:02:36.133
Ay!
-Ay! Oh!

00:02:36.133 --> 00:02:38.934
But -- Wow!

00:02:38.934 --> 00:02:41.234
That would have been a great
"True Confessions."

00:02:41.234 --> 00:02:42.467
-Yeah.

00:02:42.467 --> 00:02:45.701
